# Env
.env
.env.*.local
.env.testing
.env.testing.*
# Hand-made copies taken before editing .env. `.env` alone does not match these,
# so a `.env.bak-20260820` sitting in the repo shows as untracked and a later
# `git add -A` commits every live secret. Hit for real during the 2026-08-20
# redeploy. The allow-list below still wins, so the committed templates survive.
.env.bak*
.env.backup*
.env.orig
.env.save
.env.*.bak
*.env.swp
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
!.env.dusk.example

